OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine on offer this evening
OL,7,Fleaving long clear spells across the
OL,8,Fregion overnight. Under clear skies
OL,9,Ftemperatures will be allowed to
OL,10,Frapidly fall away, with a rural frost
OL,11,Fpossible in prone spots.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FAnother sunny start on Sunday
OL,14,Fwith patchy cloud once again bubbling
OL,15,Fup. The odd isolated shower cannot be
OL,16,Fruled out. Remaining chilly, with
OL,17,Flight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
