OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FCloudier to start the week with some
OL,7,Fmostly light rain developing at times
OL,8,Fon Monday and Tuesday. Some brighter
OL,9,Fspells also possible. Further rain
OL,10,Fexpected midweek, and perhaps turning
OL,11,Fwindy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
